					"text": "*Filter:* superset\nCan someone rate my leg day for jumping higher?\n\n1. Sprinter drills, dynamic warm-up, ankle and hip mobility. - 15 minutes. \n\n2. 3 X plyo superset. \n\n-Jump squats, 10 reps for height. \n-Skater jumps 10 reps each leg\nPogos\nPlenty of rest between\n\n3. Heavy lifts\n\n2X10-12 split squats\n2X15 leg extensions and leg curls\n1X20 calf raises to failure. \n\n4. Cardio, usually the stair machine or the rower.",
